<title>USA: Imperial Credit sets dividend reinvestment.</title>
<headline>Imperial Credit sets dividend reinvestment.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA HEIGHTS, Calif. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Credit Mortgage Holdings Inc said Monday its board of directors has approved a dividend reinvestment and stock purchase plan.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it has registered 1.7 million shares that will be available from the company for issuance pursuant to dividend reinvestment and optional cash purchases.</p>
<p>Imperial has approved a 3 percent discount to stockholders on all or partial dividend reinvestments to the extent shares are purchased directly from the company.</p>
<p>Participation in the plan will be available to stockholders beginning with the company's 1997 first quarter dividend payment.</p>
</text>
